---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms of service for REX Bunny Services."
>
  <section class="pt-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="mb-8 text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">Terms of Service</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-invert text-sm text-dark-300">
        <p>Last updated: 2026</p>
        <h2 class="text-white">Services</h2>
        <p>REX Bunny Services provides web development, technical SEO, and AI search optimization (GEO) services. Specific deliverables, timelines, and pricing are outlined in individual service agreements.</p>
        <h2 class="text-white">Free Audit Tool</h2>
        <p>The free AI Visibility & SEO Audit tool is provided as-is. Results are for informational purposes and should not be considered a comprehensive SEO or GEO audit. We reserve the right to limit usage of the free tool.</p>
        <h2 class="text-white">Payment</h2>
        <p>Payment terms are outlined in individual service agreements. All fees are non-refundable unless otherwise specified.</p>
        <h2 class="text-white">Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>Upon full payment, clients retain ownership of all custom code, content, and assets produced by REX Bunny Services. We retain the right to display completed work in our portfolio.</p>
        <h2 class="text-white">Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>REX Bunny Services is not liable for indirect damages including loss of revenue, data, or business interruption. Our liability is limited to the total fees paid for the specific service giving rise to the claim.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
